@startuml
!include includes/style.puml
allow_mixing

title 部署（v0.2）
caption 3 个应用容器 + 1 个 PostgreSQL；worker / Redis / MinIO / Caddy 都是按需增加。

node "用户设备" {
  component "浏览器 / 飞书客户端" as Client <<external>>
}

node "家庭服务器 / NAS（Docker Compose）" as Host {
  package "应用容器" {
    component "home-web\nNext.js" as Web <<service>>
    component "home-core\nDjango" as Core <<service>>
    component "home-ai\nFastAPI" as AI <<agent>>
  }

  package "数据" {
    database "PostgreSQL\ncore + ai schema" as PG
    folder "本地卷\nuploads / knowledge" as Disk
    queue "Redis（可选）" as Redis
    database "MinIO（可选）" as MinIO
  }
}

cloud "外部（可选）" {
  component "LLM / VLM API" as LLM <<external>>
  component "飞书" as Feishu <<external>>
}

Client --> Web : 局域网 / 远程
Web --> Core : REST
Web --> AI : REST / SSE
Core --> PG
AI --> PG
AI --> Disk
AI --> LLM
AI -.-> Redis : 需要队列时
AI -.-> MinIO : 需要对象存储时
AI -.-> Feishu : 通知 / 审批卡片

note right of Host
  **先简单**
  · 只跑 web/core/ai + PG
  · 长任务：用同一个 ai 镜像另起 worker 容器
  · Redis / MinIO / Caddy 都是后加
  · 远程用 VPN；需要 TLS/反代时再加 Caddy
end note

note bottom of PG
  一个实例、两个 schema；
  每个 schema 独立 dump。
end note

legend right
  |= 颜色 |= 含义 |
  | <color:#DBEAFE>■</color> | 业务/Web |
  | <color:#DCFCE7>■</color> | AI |
  | <color:#FEF3C7>■</color> | 数据 |
  | <color:#E2E8F0>■</color> | 可选基础设施 |
  | <color:#F3E8FF>■</color> | 外部 |
endlegend

@enduml
